From 5c8b6b3af1847356d419d429743a6f9125f773a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kartheek Nagasuri <kartheek@artiumacademy.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 06:17:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20nested=20pages=20=E2=80=94=20sub-pa?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ges,=20tree=20view,=20move=20to=20page,=20breadcrumbs?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backend
- Page list returns every page with `parent` and a visibility-aware
  `sub_pages_count`; `?parent=<id>` and `?root_only=true` filters.
- Parent validation on create and update: same project, not archived,
  not itself, not one of its own descendants.
- Sub-pages inherit the parent's access on create unless specified.
- New endpoints: pages/<id>/sub-pages/ and pages/<id>/parents/ (ancestor
  chain for breadcrumbs), both honouring the guest restriction.
- Summary counts include nested pages.

Frontend
- TPageExtended / ExtendedBasePage carry parent, sub_pages_count and
  sort_order; updateParent() with optimistic update and rollback.
- Store: root/children/ancestor/descendant selectors; create and delete
  keep parent counts in sync; archive/restore sync the loaded subtree.
- Pages list renders a collapsible tree (auto-expanded while searching).
- Page actions gain "Add sub-page" and "Move to page" (picker excludes
  the page and its descendants).
- Page header shows ancestor breadcrumbs.

